        "title": "SodaTide® - Official / website-Gut & Metabolic Balance",
        "meta_descr": "SodaTide pairs a prebiotic fiber blend with three targeted probiotic strains in one easy morning capsule, so digestion, appetite signals and metabolic wellness can work together instead of against each other.",
        "header_custom": "<meta name=\"keywords\" content=\"prosta defend, prostadefend, prosta defend supplement, prosta defend pills\">\n <meta name=\"author\" content=\"prosta defend\">\n\t\t\n <link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"\" >",
