          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"formulam5 people3\" group=\"People\" data-bg-video=\"{{bg.type == 'video' && bg.value.url}}\" mbr-class=\"{'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n  <mbr-parameters>\n    <header>Size</header>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n    <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"0\">\n    <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"0\">\n    <select title=\"Columns\" name=\"cardsWidth\">\n      <option value=\"6\">2</option>\n      <option value=\"4\" selected>3</option>\n      <option value=\"3\">4</option>\n    </select>\n    <header>Show/Hide</header>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showMainTitle\">\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Subtitle\" name=\"showMainSubtitle\">\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Buttons\" name=\"showButtons\">\n\n    <header>Card</header>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Text\" name=\"showTitle\" checked>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Name\" name=\"showText\" checked>\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Status\" name=\"showSubtitle\">\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Stars\" name=\"showStars\" checked>\n\n    <input type=\"color\" title=\"Icon Color\" name=\"iconColor\" value=\"#ca9236\" selected>\n    <header>Background</header>\n    <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n      <input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value parallax>\n      <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#ffffff\" selected>\n      <input type=\"video\" title=\"Video\" value=\"https://vimeo.com/428046504\">\n    </fieldset>\n    <header condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">Fallback Image</header>\n    <input type=\"image\" title=\"Fallback Image\" value name=\"fallBackImage\" condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">\n    <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\" checked>\n    <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.5\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n  </mbr-parameters>\n\n  <div class=\"mbr-fallback-image disabled\" mbr-if=\"bg.type == 'video'\"></div>\n  <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type!== 'color'\" mbr-style=\"{'opacity': overlayOpacity, 'background-color': overlayColor}\"></div>\n  <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n    <div class=\"row mb-5 justify-content-center\">\n      <div class=\"col-12 content-head\" mbr-if=\"showMainTitle || showMainSubtitle\" mbr-class=\"{'col-lg-9': cardsAmount == '3'}\">\n        <h3 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style align-center mb-4\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\" mbr-if=\"showMainTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\">\n          <b>Testimonials</b>\n        </h3>\n        <h5 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style align-center mb-4\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showMainSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\">\n          Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet nulla vel, consectetur massa adipiscing.\n        </h5>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n      <div class=\"item features-without-image col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-{{cardsWidth}} mb-3 active\">\n        <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n          <div class=\"card-box align-center\">\n            <div class=\"iconfont-wrapper mb-3\" mbr-if=\"showStars\">\n              <span mbr-icon class=\"mbr-iconfont mobi-mbri-star mobi-mbri\"></span>\n              <span mbr-icon class=\"mbr-iconfont mobi-mbri-star mobi-mbri\"></span>\n              <span mbr-icon class=\"mbr-iconfont mobi-mbri-star mobi-mbri\"></span>\n              <span mbr-icon class=\"mbr-iconfont mobi-mbri-star mobi-mbri\"></span>\n              <span mbr-icon class=\"mbr-iconfont mobi-mbri-star mobi-mbri\"></span>\n            </div>\n            <h4 class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".card-title, .iconfont-wrapper\">\n<div><br></div><div><b>\"Lost 12 lbs and my sugar cravings are completely gone.\"</b></div><div><br></div><div>\"As someone in my late 40s, losing weight felt almost impossible despite eating clean and working out regularly. My doctor mentioned my gut health might be slowing down my metabolic rate. I ordered SodaTide, and it has been an absolute game-changer. I noticed my intense late-night sugar cravings vanished within the first ten days. Fast forward two months, and I'm down 12 pounds without feeling starved or exhausted. My energy levels are steady all day long. Highly recommend it to anyone dealing with a stubborn metabolism!\"</div></h4>\n            <img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/gingerfit-review-2.webp\" alt=\"Mark H\" title data-slide-to=\"1\" data-bs-slide-to=\"1\">\n\n            <p class=\"card-text mbr-fonts-style mb-1\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".card-text\"><b>David K., Verified Buyer</b><br></p>\n\n            <h5 class=\"card-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mb-3\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".card-subtitle\">\n              Client</h5>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"item features-without-image col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-{{cardsWidth}} mb-3\">\n        <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n          <div class=\"card-box align-center\">\n            <div class=\"iconfont-wrapper mb-3\" mbr-if=\"showStars\">\n              <span mbr-icon class=\"mbr-iconfont mobi-mbri-star mobi-mbri\"></span>\n              <span mbr-icon class=\"mbr-iconfont mobi-mbri-star mobi-mbri\"></span>\n              <span mbr-icon class=\"mbr-iconfont mobi-mbri-star mobi-mbri\"></span>\n              <span mbr-icon class=\"mbr-iconfont mobi-mbri-star mobi-mbri\"></span>\n              <span mbr-icon class=\"mbr-iconfont mobi-mbri-star mobi-mbri\"></span>\n            </div>\n            <h4 class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".card-title, .iconfont-wrapper\"><b>\"Gentle on the stomach and actually delivers results.\"</b><div><br></div><div>\"Many weight loss supplements leave me feeling anxious, nauseous, or jittery because of high caffeine content. What I love about SodaTide is how gentle yet effective it is. It doesn't contain any artificial stimulants, so there are zero side effects. My digestion is more regular than it has ever been, my skin looks clearer, and I feel significantly lighter every day. I keep my bottle in the fridge like suggested, and taking one capsule every morning has easily become my favorite healthy routine.\"</div></h4>\n            <img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/t-401.webp\" alt=\"Charlie Williams\" title data-slide-to=\"2\" data-bs-slide-to=\"2\">\n\n            <p class=\"card-text mbr-fonts-style mb-1\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".card-text\"><b>Amanda L., Verified Buyer</b><br></p>\n\n            <h5 class=\"card-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mb-3\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".card-subtitle\">\n              Client</h5>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div><div class=\"item features-without-image col-12 col-md-6 col-lg-{{cardsWidth}} mb-3\">\n        <div class=\"item-wrapper\">\n          <div class=\"card-box align-center\">\n            <div class=\"iconfont-wrapper mb-3\" mbr-if=\"showStars\">\n              <span mbr-icon class=\"mbr-iconfont mobi-mbri-star mobi-mbri\"></span>\n              <span mbr-icon class=\"mbr-iconfont mobi-mbri-star mobi-mbri\"></span>\n              <span mbr-icon class=\"mbr-iconfont mobi-mbri-star mobi-mbri\"></span>\n              <span mbr-icon class=\"mbr-iconfont mobi-mbri-star mobi-mbri\"></span>\n              <span mbr-icon class=\"mbr-iconfont mobi-mbri-star mobi-mbri\"></span>\n            </div>\n            <h4 class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".card-title, .iconfont-wrapper\">\n<div><b>\"Finally found something that stops the afternoon bloating!\"</b></div><div><br></div><div>\"I have struggled with severe post-meal bloating and sluggish digestion for years, especially after lunch at work. I tried different probiotic pills, but none made a noticeable difference until I gave SodaTide a shot. Within about two weeks of taking it every morning, the uncomfortable fullness completely disappeared. My stomach feels visibly flatter, I don't get midday energy slumps, and my appetite feels completely balanced throughout the day. It has truly restored my gut comfort and daily confidence!\"</div></h4>\n            <img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/t-43.webp\" alt=\"John D.\" title>\n\n            <p class=\"card-text mbr-fonts-style mb-1\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".card-text\"><b>Sarah M., Verified Buyer</b><br></p>\n\n            <h5 class=\"card-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mb-3\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".card-subtitle\">\n              Client</h5>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      \n\n\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"row mt-0 mt-md-5\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\">\n      <div class=\"col-12 align-center\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\">\n        <div mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" class=\"mbr-section-btn\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\">\n          <a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"https://mobiri.se\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">Read More</a>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>",
